  m_text: "+   ADD          7 + 3 = 10\r\n\u2212   SUBTRACT     7 \u2212 3 = 4\r\n\xD7   MULTIPLY     7 \xD7 3 = 21\r\n\xF7   DIVIDE       7 \xF7 2 = 4\r\n    (ROUNDS UP: 3.5 \u2192 4)\r\n%   REMAINDER    7 % 3 = 1\r\n    (7 = 3 + 3 + 1)\r\n\r\n4 NEXT TO 5 = 45"
